# The API image (apps/api/Dockerfile) needs only the workspace manifests, the lockfile, the API and uma-server; private
# content/ (tens of GB), art, docs and every other package stay out of the build context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!scripts/*/package.json
!tools/*/package.json
!apps/api
!packages/server
apps/api/node_modules
apps/api/dist
packages/server/node_modules
packages/server/dist
